# What lives on ONE server and is not part of the platform: the extra sites the owner added,
# the Caddyfile generated from them, its backups, and the files a static site serves.
# The folders themselves are kept (.gitkeep) so the base Caddyfile's imports always resolve to
# a real directory. To version your own drop-ins, delete the two `*.d/*` lines.
sites.d/*
!sites.d/.gitkeep
paths.d/*
!paths.d/.gitkeep
static/*
!static/.gitkeep
live/
backups/
generated/
.selftest-*/
